You are invited to join <%= @group.name %> on Chorifico. Sign in to answer:
<%= new_session_url(email: @email, return_to: group_invitation_url(@group, only_path: true)) %>

The link opens the sign-in form with your address already in it, and it does not expire.
Nothing is sent until you press the form's button, which emails you a sign-in link.
Once you are signed in, you can join the group or decline.
